---- MODULE GameOfLife ----
EXTENDS Naturals, TLC

CONSTANT N

\* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
\* State variables
\* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
VARIABLES grid

\* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
\* Derived sets
\* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
Pos == 1..N \X 1..N

Abs(x) == IF x < 0 THEN -x ELSE x

Neighbors(p) == { q \in Pos :
                    /\ q # p
                    /\ Abs(p[1] - q[1]) <= 1
                    /\ Abs(p[2] - q[2]) <= 1 }

\* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
\* Type invariant
\* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
TypeOK == /\ grid \in [Pos -> BOOLEAN]

\* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
\* Initialization: any configuration of alive/dead cells
\* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
Init == /\ TypeOK

\* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
\* Next-state relation: simultaneous Game‑of‑Life update
\* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
Next ==
  /\ \A p \in Pos :
        LET cnt == Cardinality({ q \in Pos : q \in Neighbors(p) /\ grid[q] })
        IN grid'[p] =
            IF grid[p] THEN (cnt = 2 \/ cnt = 3)
            ELSE (cnt = 3)
  /\ UNCHANGED << >>

\* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
\* Specification
\* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
Spec == Init /\ [][Next]_<<grid>>

====